            "line": 1010,
            "text": "def TrueAt (F : Profile) (XR : ℝ) (c : ℝ → Coeff) (p : Point) : Prop :=\n  0 < Qs F XR c p ∧ 0 < radialA F XR c p ∧ 2 < normalV F XR c p ∧\n  2 < normalP F XR c p ∧ normalV F XR c p < ConeAlgebra.coneBound (normalP F XR c p) (normalJ F XR c p)"
